  // bridge from that interpreter, and a distro package may ship the office
  // without one. Answering "soffice" here regardless is how `deps` came to report
  // LibreOffice present while the UNO leg could never run.
  if (onPath.status === 0 && (!uno || unoPython())) return "soffice";
  ...
}
```
